{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >I welcome you to <u><strong>NotSnail Corp</strong></u><strong>.</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Where a simple pigeon monster from the cleaning staff is about to turn this monster-filled workplace upside down.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3433240/extras/dc9aa8a092f5ccc93f6c1aeb9b3f6a99.poster.avif?t=1763662998\" width=1170 height=366 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3433240/extras/dc9aa8a092f5ccc93f6c1aeb9b3f6a99.webm?t=1763662998\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3433240/extras/dc9aa8a092f5ccc93f6c1aeb9b3f6a99.mp4?t=1763662998\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Take control of a despised janitor who's tired of being stepped on and climb through NotSnail Corp. by <strong>devouring your enemies</strong> to gain rewards and <strong>become more powerful</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3433240/extras/c91cdad2618bc5290d7a6f8d2fda0d57.poster.avif?t=1763662998\" width=1170 height=548 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3433240/extras/c91cdad2618bc5290d7a6f8d2fda0d57.webm?t=1763662998\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3433240/extras/c91cdad2618bc5290d7a6f8d2fda0d57.mp4?t=1763662998\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><u><strong>KEY FEATURES:</strong></u></p><p class=\"b